                    "sense_definition": "To cause harm or have a negative effect on something, such as health.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "harm",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "Some people believe that certain habits do not <w>hinder</w> your health as much as doctors claim.",
